  "duration_s": 285.370998,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "从今天开始，玲玲就是我们销售部的经理，大家鼓掌。祝贺王姐，凭什么玲玲能当经理？我不能我俩。可是同时进公司的，我每天来的比他早，走的比他晚，为什么这个位置不能让我来坐小张啊？你平时的努力大家都看得到，但是工作可不是光靠勤奋就能做好的。正好今天有个酒局，我叫上玲玲一起去参加怎么样？今晚有空吗？有空，哎呀，这肯定迟到了呀，今天这场商务洽谈很重要，去晚了可咋办呀？急什么合作方那边能够理解路况，堵车的没关系，兵来将挡水来土掩，有王姐在怕啥？今天我当个观众能不能拿下这笔大业务，就看你俩的表现了哟。来这么晚只能吃剩饭了吧。王总，真不好意思，路上太堵了。我们哎呀，王总饭在哪儿？我们都能吃，但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，能赶上已经是我们的运气了。哈哈哈哈哈哈，赶紧坐吧，位置都给你们留。好了，各位领导，不好意思，今天迟到了，我们给大家敬一个来小张，你来起个头吧，大家吃好喝。好，我干了领导们随意，这就完了。嗯，完了，哎，来琳琳，你也给大家敬一个这俗话说，跟着领导走，吃喝啥都有，跟着领导干呀，年年赚个几百万。来这杯酒祝领导们左手招财，右手富平安，席乐万事足干杯。你们公司呀虽然能力强，但是个个心高气傲，就像这藕偶是好偶啊，就是心眼儿太多了。领导者虽然心眼多，但也是您的下酒菜。啊啊，哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，这鱼是好鱼，就是刺多。领导，您看鱼虽然刺多，但主心骨只有一根心腹是没有刺的。哈哈哈哈啊，嗯小伙子帮我打碗饭。嗯嗯，好好好，打这么多，你喂猪呢，王总小张哪敢啊？他以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，都说宰相肚里能撑船，更何况只是一碗饭呢。哈哈哈什么意思呀？怎么到我这儿只剩半杯了？是因为我职位不如王总，李总看不上我，对吧？钱总美满，美满，代表幸福美满，这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满。啊哈哈哈哈哈，你酒量挺好的呀，领导您可抬举我了，我平时真不太能喝。这不今天和您在一起吃饭，高兴啊，这一高兴就多贪了几杯。呃，哈哈哈哈哈王姐这顿饭吃的很开心，这个小姑娘我看挺灵光，新项目交给他，我也放心，行，这笔生意就这么定了，放心吧，王总您慢走怎么样？一顿饭就看出来你和玲玲的差距了吧。可不是嘛，王姐这琳琳也太会说了，我离她差得远呢，这下我输的心服口服，你呀多看看这本把话说的恰到好处。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交，你就每天看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你也会变成一个会说话的人。在这本书里有一句话，我特别欣赏，他，写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，你可以回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当有人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下吴弱兵，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？每一句都很有意思，就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下应该怎么说。书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心的拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。但凡学会三分，你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。我这就回去看。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00001",
      "start_ms": 190,
      "end_ms": 1170,
      "text": "从今天开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1450,
      "end_ms": 3410,
      "text": "玲玲就是我们销售部的经理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3710,
      "end_ms": 4310,
      "text": "大家鼓掌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4310,
      "end_ms": 11640,
      "text": "祝贺王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00005",
      "start_ms": 12020,
      "end_ms": 13240,
      "text": "凭什么玲玲能当经理？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13240,
      "end_ms": 14280,
      "text": "我不能我俩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00007",
      "start_ms": 14280,
      "end_ms": 15460,
      "text": "可是同时进公司的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00008",
      "start_ms": 15700,
      "end_ms": 16920,
      "text": "我每天来的比他早，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00009",
      "start_ms": 16920,
      "end_ms": 17680,
      "text": "走的比他晚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00010",
      "start_ms": 17980,
      "end_ms": 20480,
      "text": "为什么这个位置不能让我来坐小张啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00011",
      "start_ms": 20660,
      "end_ms": 22460,
      "text": "你平时的努力大家都看得到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00012",
      "start_ms": 22680,
      "end_ms": 25080,
      "text": "但是工作可不是光靠勤奋就能做好的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00013",
      "start_ms": 25160,
      "end_ms": 26340,
      "text": "正好今天有个酒局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00014",
      "start_ms": 26480,
      "end_ms": 28740,
      "text": "我叫上玲玲一起去参加怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00015",
      "start_ms": 29020,
      "end_ms": 29820,
      "text": "今晚有空吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00016",
      "start_ms": 30120,
      "end_ms": 30540,
      "text": "有空，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00017",
      "start_ms": 30800,
      "end_ms": 31260,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00018",
      "start_ms": 31340,
      "end_ms": 32500,
      "text": "这肯定迟到了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00019",
      "start_ms": 32640,
      "end_ms": 34240,
      "text": "今天这场商务洽谈很重要，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00020",
      "start_ms": 34660,
      "end_ms": 35980,
      "text": "去晚了可咋办呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00021",
      "start_ms": 36260,
      "end_ms": 39240,
      "text": "急什么合作方那边能够理解路况，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00022",
      "start_ms": 39240,
      "end_ms": 41690,
      "text": "堵车的没关系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00023",
      "start_ms": 42230,
      "end_ms": 43790,
      "text": "兵来将挡水来土掩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00024",
      "start_ms": 43990,
      "end_ms": 45210,
      "text": "有王姐在怕啥？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00025",
      "start_ms": 46190,
      "end_ms": 49310,
      "text": "今天我当个观众能不能拿下这笔大业务，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00026",
      "start_ms": 49330,
      "end_ms": 53080,
      "text": "就看你俩的表现了哟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00027",
      "start_ms": 53500,
      "end_ms": 55280,
      "text": "来这么晚只能吃剩饭了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00028",
      "start_ms": 55560,
      "end_ms": 56000,
      "text": "王总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00029",
      "start_ms": 56340,
      "end_ms": 57240,
      "text": "真不好意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00030",
      "start_ms": 57480,
      "end_ms": 58480,
      "text": "路上太堵了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00031",
      "start_ms": 58480,
      "end_ms": 59640,
      "text": "我们哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00032",
      "start_ms": 59640,
      "end_ms": 60970,
      "text": "王总饭在哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00033",
      "start_ms": 60970,
      "end_ms": 61705,
      "text": "我们都能吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00034",
      "start_ms": 62060,
      "end_ms": 64060,
      "text": "但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00035",
      "start_ms": 64140,
      "end_ms": 65964,
      "text": "能赶上已经是我们的运气了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00036",
      "start_ms": 66310,
      "end_ms": 67510,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00037",
      "start_ms": 68550,
      "end_ms": 69450,
      "text": "赶紧坐吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00038",
      "start_ms": 69590,
      "end_ms": 70550,
      "text": "位置都给你们留。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00039",
      "start_ms": 70550,
      "end_ms": 71175,
      "text": "好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00040",
      "start_ms": 72470,
      "end_ms": 73130,
      "text": "各位领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00041",
      "start_ms": 73350,
      "end_ms": 73970,
      "text": "不好意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00042",
      "start_ms": 73970,
      "end_ms": 74730,
      "text": "今天迟到了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00043",
      "start_ms": 74730,
      "end_ms": 76635,
      "text": "我们给大家敬一个来小张，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00044",
      "start_ms": 76940,
      "end_ms": 77925,
      "text": "你来起个头吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00045",
      "start_ms": 80840,
      "end_ms": 81660,
      "text": "大家吃好喝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00046",
      "start_ms": 81660,
      "end_ms": 82015,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00047",
      "start_ms": 82370,
      "end_ms": 84145,
      "text": "我干了领导们随意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00048",
      "start_ms": 86470,
      "end_ms": 87170,
      "text": "这就完了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00049",
      "start_ms": 87430,
      "end_ms": 87670,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00050",
      "start_ms": 87910,
      "end_ms": 88505,
      "text": "完了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00051",
      "start_ms": 88840,
      "end_ms": 89145,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00052",
      "start_ms": 90760,
      "end_ms": 91285,
      "text": "来琳琳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00053",
      "start_ms": 91610,
      "end_ms": 94625,
      "text": "你也给大家敬一个这俗话说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00054",
      "start_ms": 95090,
      "end_ms": 95890,
      "text": "跟着领导走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00055",
      "start_ms": 95910,
      "end_ms": 96610,
      "text": "吃喝啥都有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00056",
      "start_ms": 96610,
      "end_ms": 97490,
      "text": "跟着领导干呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00057",
      "start_ms": 97490,
      "end_ms": 98615,
      "text": "年年赚个几百万。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00058",
      "start_ms": 98980,
      "end_ms": 101460,
      "text": "来这杯酒祝领导们左手招财，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00059",
      "start_ms": 101460,
      "end_ms": 102460,
      "text": "右手富平安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00060",
      "start_ms": 102460,
      "end_ms": 104065,
      "text": "席乐万事足干杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00061",
      "start_ms": 105720,
      "end_ms": 107980,
      "text": "你们公司呀虽然能力强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00062",
      "start_ms": 108360,
      "end_ms": 110155,
      "text": "但是个个心高气傲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00063",
      "start_ms": 110570,
      "end_ms": 113255,
      "text": "就像这藕偶是好偶啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00064",
      "start_ms": 113630,
      "end_ms": 115075,
      "text": "就是心眼儿太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00065",
      "start_ms": 115370,
      "end_ms": 116770,
      "text": "领导者虽然心眼多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00066",
      "start_ms": 116830,
      "end_ms": 117930,
      "text": "但也是您的下酒菜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00067",
      "start_ms": 117930,
      "end_ms": 118895,
      "text": "啊啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00068",
      "start_ms": 119110,
      "end_ms": 120430,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00069",
      "start_ms": 122860,
      "end_ms": 123995,
      "text": "这鱼是好鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00070",
      "start_ms": 124750,
      "end_ms": 125725,
      "text": "就是刺多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00071",
      "start_ms": 126910,
      "end_ms": 127210,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00072",
      "start_ms": 127210,
      "end_ms": 129000,
      "text": "您看鱼虽然刺多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00073",
      "start_ms": 129140,
      "end_ms": 131365,
      "text": "但主心骨只有一根心腹是没有刺的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00074",
      "start_ms": 133170,
      "end_ms": 134590,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00075",
      "start_ms": 135340,
      "end_ms": 137415,
      "text": "嗯小伙子帮我打碗饭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00076",
      "start_ms": 137760,
      "end_ms": 138160,
      "text": "嗯嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00077",
      "start_ms": 138160,
      "end_ms": 138725,
      "text": "好好好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00078",
      "start_ms": 143920,
      "end_ms": 144580,
      "text": "打这么多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00079",
      "start_ms": 144620,
      "end_ms": 145525,
      "text": "你喂猪呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00080",
      "start_ms": 145930,
      "end_ms": 147375,
      "text": "王总小张哪敢啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00081",
      "start_ms": 147620,
      "end_ms": 149755,
      "text": "他以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00082",
      "start_ms": 150290,
      "end_ms": 152405,
      "text": "都说宰相肚里能撑船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00083",
      "start_ms": 152820,
      "end_ms": 154155,
      "text": "更何况只是一碗饭呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00084",
      "start_ms": 155210,
      "end_ms": 172150,
      "text": "哈哈哈什么意思呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00085",
      "start_ms": 172250,
      "end_ms": 173965,
      "text": "怎么到我这儿只剩半杯了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00086",
      "start_ms": 174810,
      "end_ms": 176210,
      "text": "是因为我职位不如王总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00087",
      "start_ms": 176210,
      "end_ms": 177070,
      "text": "李总看不上我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00088",
      "start_ms": 177070,
      "end_ms": 177455,
      "text": "对吧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00089",
      "start_ms": 178150,
      "end_ms": 179490,
      "text": "钱总美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00090",
      "start_ms": 179490,
      "end_ms": 179925,
      "text": "美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00091",
      "start_ms": 180200,
      "end_ms": 181315,
      "text": "代表幸福美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00092",
      "start_ms": 181650,
      "end_ms": 183670,
      "text": "这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00093",
      "start_ms": 183670,
      "end_ms": 186205,
      "text": "啊哈哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00094",
      "start_ms": 188160,
      "end_ms": 189605,
      "text": "你酒量挺好的呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00095",
      "start_ms": 190110,
      "end_ms": 191535,
      "text": "领导您可抬举我了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00096",
      "start_ms": 191960,
      "end_ms": 193375,
      "text": "我平时真不太能喝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00097",
      "start_ms": 193810,
      "end_ms": 195530,
      "text": "这不今天和您在一起吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00098",
      "start_ms": 195690,
      "end_ms": 196465,
      "text": "高兴啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00099",
      "start_ms": 196760,
      "end_ms": 198555,
      "text": "这一高兴就多贪了几杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00100",
      "start_ms": 200630,
      "end_ms": 200870,
      "text": "呃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00101",
      "start_ms": 201320,
      "end_ms": 205715,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈王姐这顿饭吃的很开心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00102",
      "start_ms": 206400,
      "end_ms": 208035,
      "text": "这个小姑娘我看挺灵光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00103",
      "start_ms": 208510,
      "end_ms": 209470,
      "text": "新项目交给他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00104",
      "start_ms": 209470,
      "end_ms": 210175,
      "text": "我也放心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00105",
      "start_ms": 210550,
      "end_ms": 210955,
      "text": "行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00106",
      "start_ms": 211420,
      "end_ms": 212745,
      "text": "这笔生意就这么定了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00107",
      "start_ms": 213020,
      "end_ms": 213460,
      "text": "放心吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00108",
      "start_ms": 213460,
      "end_ms": 220565,
      "text": "王总您慢走怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00109",
      "start_ms": 221070,
      "end_ms": 223225,
      "text": "一顿饭就看出来你和玲玲的差距了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00110",
      "start_ms": 223570,
      "end_ms": 224250,
      "text": "可不是嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00111",
      "start_ms": 224250,
      "end_ms": 226280,
      "text": "王姐这琳琳也太会说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00112",
      "start_ms": 226280,
      "end_ms": 227365,
      "text": "我离她差得远呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00113",
      "start_ms": 227720,
      "end_ms": 229095,
      "text": "这下我输的心服口服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00114",
      "start_ms": 229380,
      "end_ms": 231700,
      "text": "你呀多看看这本把话说的恰到好处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00115",
      "start_ms": 231900,
      "end_ms": 232960,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00116",
      "start_ms": 233000,
      "end_ms": 233680,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00117",
      "start_ms": 233700,
      "end_ms": 234500,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00118",
      "start_ms": 234720,
      "end_ms": 235760,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00119",
      "start_ms": 235840,
      "end_ms": 237020,
      "text": "你就每天看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00120",
      "start_ms": 237200,
      "end_ms": 238380,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00121",
      "start_ms": 238520,
      "end_ms": 240220,
      "text": "你也会变成一个会说话的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00122",
      "start_ms": 240280,
      "end_ms": 241660,
      "text": "在这本书里有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00123",
      "start_ms": 241660,
      "end_ms": 242500,
      "text": "我特别欣赏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00124",
      "start_ms": 242640,
      "end_ms": 242820,
      "text": "他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00125",
      "start_ms": 242820,
      "end_ms": 245380,
      "text": "写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00126",
      "start_ms": 245440,
      "end_ms": 246195,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00127",
      "start_ms": 246610,
      "end_ms": 247590,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00128",
      "start_ms": 247830,
      "end_ms": 249225,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00129",
      "start_ms": 249450,
      "end_ms": 250835,
      "text": "当有人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00130",
      "start_ms": 251020,
      "end_ms": 252800,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00131",
      "start_ms": 252940,
      "end_ms": 253940,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00132",
      "start_ms": 253940,
      "end_ms": 257285,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00133",
      "start_ms": 257710,
      "end_ms": 258870,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00134",
      "start_ms": 258870,
      "end_ms": 260175,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00135",
      "start_ms": 260900,
      "end_ms": 262400,
      "text": "强将手下吴弱兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00136",
      "start_ms": 262600,
      "end_ms": 264065,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00137",
      "start_ms": 264370,
      "end_ms": 265635,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00138",
      "start_ms": 265990,
      "end_ms": 269290,
      "text": "就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下应该怎么说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00139",
      "start_ms": 269650,
      "end_ms": 272685,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00140",
      "start_ms": 272990,
      "end_ms": 274290,
      "text": "你就放心的拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00141",
      "start_ms": 274490,
      "end_ms": 276135,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00142",
      "start_ms": 276490,
      "end_ms": 279005,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00143",
      "start_ms": 279520,
      "end_ms": 280760,
      "text": "但凡学会三分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00144",
      "start_ms": 281060,
      "end_ms": 283835,
      "text": "你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2d45499f73600475_s00145",
      "start_ms": 284500,
      "end_ms": 285255,
      "text": "我这就回去看。"
    }
  ],
